WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.062
Frequency counting is one of the most useful dictionary patterns.

00:00:04.062 --> 00:00:06.702
We begin with an empty dictionary.

00:00:06.702 --> 00:00:10.372
For each channel, get looks for the current count.

00:00:10.372 --> 00:00:14.462
If the channel has not appeared yet, the default is zero.

00:00:14.462 --> 00:00:15.784
Then we add one.

00:00:16.514 --> 00:00:21.844
For the current list, web appears three times, email twice, and store once.

00:00:21.844 --> 00:00:29.782
This initialize-and-increment pattern is the foundation of many category summaries.
